{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in just one month, this project is part of an ongoing creative challenge. Follow along to see what I make next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Clemens\u2019 subconscious, tasked with exploring the hidden corners of his mind. As you traverse his memories, you\u2019ll solve puzzles to unlock moments from his life, each one pulling you deeper into both joyful and painful recollections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short, narrative-driven 3D platformer combines exploration and puzzle-solving with a stylized visual art style. As you descend further into Clemens\u2019 subconscious, you\u2019ll face themes of grief, regret, and learning how to accept the past. Ultimately, your choices determine which of two endings Clemens will face, offering a deeply personal and thought-provoking journey about memory, pain, and healing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015930?t=1762190195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015930?t=1762190195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015930/834f7b6f56d802729e10c20e903f19e8a55d1801/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762190195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015930/834f7b6f56d802729e10c20e903f19e8a55d1801/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762190195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game grapples with mature themes such as grief."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in just one month, this project is part of an ongoing creative challenge. Follow along to see what I make next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Clemens\u2019 subconscious, tasked with exploring the hidden corners of his mind. As you traverse his memories, you\u2019ll solve puzzles to unlock moments from his life, each one pulling you deeper into both joyful and painful recollections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short, narrative-driven 3D platformer combines exploration and puzzle-solving with a stylized visual art style. As you descend further into Clemens\u2019 subconscious, you\u2019ll face themes of grief, regret, and learning how to accept the past. Ultimately, your choices determine which of two endings Clemens will face, offering a deeply personal and thought-provoking journey about memory, pain, and healing.</p>","developers":["No Nonsense Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015930/c50b4e1d411d1ab55436a9a57198605cd93c3a7a/header.jpg?t=1762190195","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015930/1813675018/526bc727650032aaaad94e244c04184338d38d57/1762189751/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762190193","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015930/1813675018/526bc727650032aaaad94e244c04184338d38d57/1762189751/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762190193","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015930/1813675018/526bc727650032aaaad94e244c04184338d38d57/1762189751/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762190193","id":257226214,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257226214/movie480.mp4?t=1762190193","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257226214/movie_max.mp4?t=1762190193"},"name":"One Left - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226214/88cbcb5cc3a68dfa4879e58d1e076ac946f22522/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762190193","webm":{"480":"https:/